    19	
    20	Managers MUST reject unknown configuration fields and apply schema defaults
    21	before use. `projects` member names, `project_alias`, and `checkout_alias` are
    22	portable identifiers; the latter two default to the member name when absent or
    23	null. They are derived machine matching keys, distinct from the operator-facing
    24	Unicode `Skillfile.json` `project.alias`. Agent lists are sets of portable
    25	identifiers. `preferred_locale: null` means no machine preference.
